WEBVTT

00:00:05.463 --> 00:00:10.302
Because I felt the possibility,

00:00:10.302 --> 00:00:15.056
I knew to carry on.

00:00:15.056 --> 00:00:19.978
I don't want to have any more regrets.

00:00:19.978 --> 00:00:26.443
Our destined path is before us, so...

00:00:26.443 --> 00:00:31.114
LET'S GO! DO! I DO! I LIVE!

00:00:31.114 --> 00:00:35.660
YES, DO!1 DO! I LIVE!

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:37.162
LET'S GO, LET'S GO! Yeah!

00:00:37.162 --> 00:00:39.914
That's me—Kosaka Honoka.
I'm in my second year of high school.

00:00:39.914 --> 00:00:43.793
The school I attend, Otonokizaka High,
is in a major pinch right now.

00:00:43.793 --> 00:00:46.212
It started yesterday, when all of a sudden...

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:50.300
the board director announced our
school's impending closure.

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:51.885
School Closure

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:53.720
Y-You're kidding me!

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:55.221
Closing the school...

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:58.558
This will essentially remove our
school from the history books.

00:00:59.976 --> 00:01:01.061
Honoka!

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:02.187
Honoka-chan?

00:01:02.187 --> 00:01:04.147
M-My...

00:01:04.356 --> 00:01:05.857
Honoka!

00:01:05.857 --> 00:01:07.651
Honoka-chan!

00:01:07.651 --> 00:01:08.985
School Closure

00:01:08.985 --> 00:01:12.322
My dazzling high school career...!

00:01:24.501 --> 00:01:29.631
<i>Massugu ha omoi ga minna wo musubu Our honest
feelings are what will fie us all together.</i>

00:01:29.631 --> 00:01:34.636
Honki demo bukiyou butsukari au kokoro Even with
our clumsy sincerity, our hearts will still collide.

00:01:34.636 --> 00:01:39.391
Sore demo mitaiyo ohkina yume wa And despite
it all, we want to dream a really grand dream.

00:01:39.391 --> 00:01:43.978
Koko ni aruyo hajimatta bakari That dream
is here, and it has only now just begun!

00:01:43.978 --> 00:01:45.063
(wakatteru)
(We understand)

00:01:45.063 --> 00:01:48.983
Tanoshii dakejanai tamesarerudarou That it's not
all fun and games— we'll face a lot of obstacles.

00:01:48.983 --> 00:01:49.943
(wakatteru)
(We understand)

00:01:49.943 --> 00:01:53.738
Datte sono kurushisa mo mirai That those
hardships will be paving our futures...

00:01:53.738 --> 00:01:54.781
ikundayo
So here we go!

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:58.952
Atsumattara tsuyoi jibun ni nattekuyo If we all
join together, we'll be able to become stronger.

00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:03.540
(Kittone) kawari tsuzukete (WE'LL BE A STARY/) (We're sure
that) we will all grow and mature. (We'll become stars!)

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:08.586
Sorezore ga sukina koto de ganbarerunara That's why we feel
that if we give the things that we love the most our all,

00:02:08.586 --> 00:02:13.216
atarashii (basho ga) gohru dane what awaits
then (our new place) will be our goal.

00:02:13.216 --> 00:02:18.388
Sorezore no sukina koto wo shinjiteireba That's why we
feel that if we believe in the things we love in our lives,

00:02:18.388 --> 00:02:23.393
tokimeki wo (daite) susumerudarou we can learn to
love (then embrace) our butterflies and advance!

00:02:23.393 --> 00:02:28.857
(kowagaru kuse wa sutechae) tobikiri no egao de So crumple up your
fears, throw them away, and then just put on your brightest smiles!

00:02:28.857 --> 00:02:36.448
(tonde tonde takaku) bokura wa ima no naka de (Higher and higher
we"ll fly!) The lights that are shining within our hearts...

00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:41.202
kagayaki wo matteta
They're waiting to brighten the world.

00:02:46.082 --> 00:02:47.250
A bad dream!?

00:02:48.626 --> 00:02:50.003
Of course it was!

00:02:52.172 --> 00:02:53.381
Good morning!

00:02:53.715 --> 00:02:56.718
#1 - May Our Dream Come True!
Good morning, Hideko, Fumiko, and Mika!

00:02:56.718 --> 00:02:58.136
It's another dazzling day!

00:02:59.053 --> 00:03:00.889
Did she finally lose it?

00:03:01.264 --> 00:03:04.517
Honoka-chan acting cheery
is all well and good, but...

00:03:04.517 --> 00:03:06.561
I think she's just confused.

00:03:06.561 --> 00:03:07.854
Well, duh!

00:03:07.854 --> 00:03:12.609
There's no way they'd suddenly
decide to do something li—

00:03:12.609 --> 00:03:13.985
School Closure

00:03:17.238 --> 00:03:20.033
Um, Honoka-chan, are you okay?

00:03:20.325 --> 00:03:21.075
Sure...

00:03:23.953 --> 00:03:27.123
Our school's gonna close,
our school's gonna close...

00:03:28.208 --> 00:03:30.794
Honoka-chan seems pretty depressed.

00:03:30.794 --> 00:03:33.338
I didn't know she loved school this much...

00:03:33.338 --> 00:03:36.716
You're mistaken. I don't believe
that's actually the reason.

00:03:36.716 --> 00:03:38.009
Oh, really?

00:03:39.928 --> 00:03:43.389
What am I gonna do? I haven't studied at all!

00:03:43.932 --> 00:03:44.682
What?

00:03:44.682 --> 00:03:48.686
If our school closes, I gotta enroll
at another school, right?

00:03:48.686 --> 00:03:51.648
That means I gotta study and
take a test to transfer in!

00:03:51.648 --> 00:03:52.524
As I thought.

00:03:52.524 --> 00:03:53.900
Honoka-chan, calm dow—

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:56.152
Kotori-chan and Umi-chan,
you two will be fine!

00:03:56.152 --> 00:03:59.364
You've got pretty good grades! As for me...

00:03:59.364 --> 00:04:00.865
We said to calm down!

00:04:00.865 --> 00:04:04.202
Our school won't close until
after we graduate!

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:05.036
Huh?

00:04:07.413 --> 00:04:11.709
Even if our school closes, it won't be
until all the current students graduate.

00:04:11.709 --> 00:04:13.378
That means we have at least three years.

00:04:13.378 --> 00:04:15.004
That's a relief!

00:04:15.004 --> 00:04:17.257
The bread tastes delicious again today!

00:04:18.341 --> 00:04:19.467
You'll gain weight.

00:04:19.717 --> 00:04:21.970
If they do make the decision official, though,

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:26.850
we won't enroll first year students next year,
so only second and third years will be here...

00:04:27.267 --> 00:04:31.271
So the current first years will never
have any underclassmen...

00:04:32.355 --> 00:04:33.648
I see.

00:04:36.192 --> 00:04:36.985
Hey.

00:04:39.988 --> 00:04:41.030
Got a minute?

00:04:41.489 --> 00:04:42.574
S-Sure!

00:04:42.574 --> 00:04:43.825
Wh-Who's that, again?

00:04:43.825 --> 00:04:45.285
The student council president!

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:46.661
Minami-san.

00:04:46.661 --> 00:04:47.161
Yes?

00:04:47.495 --> 00:04:50.039
You're the board director's daughter, no?

00:04:50.039 --> 00:04:51.374
[... am.

00:04:51.374 --> 00:04:53.209
Did she say anything?

00:04:53.751 --> 00:04:56.671
No. I only found out today, myself...

00:04:57.714 --> 00:05:00.383
I see. Thank you.

00:05:00.383 --> 00:05:01.259
See ya later.

00:05:01.259 --> 00:05:01.968
Excuse me!

00:05:02.927 --> 00:05:05.471
Is our school really going to close down?

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:09.267
It's nothing you need to worry about.

00:05:13.563 --> 00:05:16.232
The announcement notice said
the school's closing because

00:05:16.232 --> 00:05:19.402
we didn't get enough applications from
prospective students, right?

00:05:19.903 --> 00:05:24.407
That means the school won't close
if more students apply, right?

00:05:24.824 --> 00:05:27.619
In other words, we gotta show off
the special side of our school,

00:05:27.619 --> 00:05:29.329
and reel in a bunch of applicants!

00:05:29.329 --> 00:05:31.915
Special side? And what would that be?

00:05:31.915 --> 00:05:33.458
Let's see...

00:05:33.666 --> 00:05:36.252
Archery Grounds - Our school has a rich history!
- And?

00:05:36.252 --> 00:05:38.421
You need more!? Uh...

00:05:38.671 --> 00:05:39.756
Our school has rich traditions!

00:05:39.756 --> 00:05:40.715
Same difference, no?

00:05:40.882 --> 00:05:42.842
Really? Then, um...

00:05:43.217 --> 00:05:45.345
Um...Kotori-chan?

00:05:45.345 --> 00:05:48.640
Um... Well, I think you could say...

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:51.225
that our school has been around for a while...

00:05:52.018 --> 00:05:54.729
Kotori, were you even listening to us before?

00:05:55.021 --> 00:05:59.901
Well, I did some research, and I learned
some neat things about our clubs' activities!

00:05:59.901 --> 00:06:00.735
Really?

00:06:00.735 --> 00:06:03.905
Yes, but there was nothing all that special.

00:06:04.238 --> 00:06:08.743
Like recently, our school's most
prominent club awards have been...

00:06:09.577 --> 00:06:11.788
Abacus Club: sixth place in
the Kanto tournament.

00:06:12.747 --> 00:06:13.957
That's too obscure.

00:06:13.957 --> 00:06:16.709
Chorus: honorable mention in
Regional Preliminaries.

00:06:16.709 --> 00:06:18.670
I wish there was something better...

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:22.715
Finally, Robotics Club:
failed written examinations.

00:06:22.715 --> 00:06:24.050
That sucks!

00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:26.803
You know, we wouldn't have
an enrollment shortage...

00:06:26.803 --> 00:06:29.347
if we already had something
that made us stand out.

00:06:29.764 --> 00:06:31.099
Yeah, I guess...

00:06:32.892 --> 00:06:37.438
When I go home, I'll ask my mom
and then research a little more.

00:06:38.564 --> 00:06:41.818
But I love this school.

00:06:43.277 --> 00:06:44.654
Yeah, me too.

00:06:45.405 --> 00:06:46.155
Same here.

00:06:50.118 --> 00:06:51.369
Japanese Sweets
Homura

00:06:51.577 --> 00:06:53.287
Thank you very much.

00:06:55.164 --> 00:06:57.166
I apologize for the wait.

00:06:57.166 --> 00:06:58.501
No need.

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:02.714
Hey sis, welcome back.

00:07:03.256 --> 00:07:05.216
I'm home.

00:07:07.927 --> 00:07:08.928
Chocolate?

00:07:08.928 --> 00:07:09.804
Gimme.

00:07:09.804 --> 00:07:11.389
It has red bean paste in it.

00:07:11.389 --> 00:07:12.432
Thanks...

00:07:15.143 --> 00:07:16.853
Yuck! There's red bean paste in it!

00:07:16.853 --> 00:07:17.687
I told you!

00:07:17.687 --> 00:07:21.190
- I'm so sick of red bean paste!
- Want a white bean paste one?

00:07:21.190 --> 00:07:22.650
I'm even more sick of those!

00:07:22.817 --> 00:07:23.818
Honoka!

00:07:23.818 --> 00:07:27.155
The daughter of a Japanese sweets maker
shouldn't say she's sick of red bean paste!

00:07:27.155 --> 00:07:28.948
We can hear you out in the store!

00:07:28.948 --> 00:07:31.451
Sorry.

00:07:38.541 --> 00:07:40.376
Yukiho, is that...?

00:07:40.376 --> 00:07:45.048
UTX info? Yeah, I'm going to
apply there next year.

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:53.139
They offer all of these...?

00:07:53.139 --> 00:07:54.390
You don't know?

00:07:54.849 --> 00:07:59.854
It's the most popular school right now,
with tons of students applying.

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:02.356
That's amazing.

00:08:04.942 --> 00:08:05.818
Wait!

00:08:05.818 --> 00:08:07.028
Yukiho!

00:08:07.028 --> 00:08:09.072
You're not gonna apply to Otonokizaka!?

00:08:09.072 --> 00:08:10.239
You're just now reacting to that!?

00:08:10.865 --> 00:08:13.117
Mom! Mom!

00:08:13.117 --> 00:08:13.951
What?

00:08:13.951 --> 00:08:16.662
Yukiho says she's not gonna
go to Otonokizaka!

00:08:16.662 --> 00:08:17.580
So I heard.

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:21.459
No way! But you and Grandma
went to school there, right?

00:08:21.918 --> 00:08:23.544
Well yeah, but...

00:08:24.754 --> 00:08:27.256
Isn't Otonokizaka closing down?

00:08:27.882 --> 00:08:29.008
Word spreads fast.

00:08:29.008 --> 00:08:32.845
Everyone says there's no
point in applying there.

00:08:34.222 --> 00:08:35.556
No point?

00:08:35.556 --> 00:08:40.103
How are they wrong? You second years
can all fit in just two classrooms.

00:08:40.103 --> 00:08:42.605
But the third years take up three!

00:08:42.605 --> 00:08:43.606
And the first years?

00:08:45.024 --> 00:08:45.983
One classroom...

00:08:45.983 --> 00:08:49.195
See? That means you won't
have any next year.

00:08:49.195 --> 00:08:50.530
You don't know that!

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:53.825
Me, Kotori-chan, and Umi-chan are
thinking of ways to keep it from closing.

00:08:53.825 --> 00:08:55.326
So it's not gonna close!

00:08:56.410 --> 00:08:58.079
You're so stubborn.

00:08:58.621 --> 00:09:02.917
No matter how you look at it, this isn't
a problem you can fix yourselves.

00:09:06.337 --> 00:09:07.547
You too, Kotori-chan?

00:09:07.547 --> 00:09:08.548
Yeah...

00:09:08.548 --> 00:09:13.469
I thought my mom would be pretty upset,
but she seems happy about it...

00:09:13.886 --> 00:09:16.806
She was asking where we'd
like to go on vacation...

00:09:17.098 --> 00:09:19.267
Maybe they're right...

00:09:19.267 --> 00:09:22.395
But it's still sad, y"know?

00:09:29.902 --> 00:09:31.154
Mom?

00:09:35.783 --> 00:09:36.993
Mom.

00:09:37.743 --> 00:09:39.620
Huh? When did you come in?

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:41.372
I've been standing here for a while.

00:09:41.372 --> 00:09:43.124
Can I take my bath first?

00:09:43.124 --> 00:09:46.085
Sure, go right ahead.

00:09:52.300 --> 00:09:54.177
A graduation photo album?

00:10:34.050 --> 00:10:35.259
I'm heading out!

00:10:36.135 --> 00:10:37.803
Yukiho!

00:10:37.803 --> 00:10:39.847
I'm gonna borrow this!

00:10:43.184 --> 00:10:45.436
I can't believe she woke up this early!

00:10:45.436 --> 00:10:47.605
The last time was for her
elementary school field trip...

00:10:50.942 --> 00:10:54.779
Umi-chan, Honoka-chan told
us to go on without her.

00:10:55.029 --> 00:10:57.406
Did she oversleep again? Unbelievable...

00:10:57.406 --> 00:10:59.617
If you say it like that, she'll get all mopey.

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:08.292
Wow...

00:11:08.292 --> 00:11:10.711
This is a school?

00:11:18.886 --> 00:11:20.179
It's amazing!

00:11:24.892 --> 00:11:27.478
Welcome to UTX High!

00:11:28.271 --> 00:11:31.607
How's everyone feeling today?

00:11:31.607 --> 00:11:33.109
It's them.

00:11:36.946 --> 00:11:38.447
E-Excuse me.

00:11:38.447 --> 00:11:39.031
What?

00:11:39.865 --> 00:11:41.659
I'm very busy.

00:11:42.076 --> 00:11:44.787
Um, I have a question.

00:11:44.787 --> 00:11:47.331
Are those girls celebrities or something?

00:11:47.331 --> 00:11:48.291
What!?

00:11:48.791 --> 00:11:51.043
You don't even know that much?

00:11:51.043 --> 00:11:53.296
It's written in the pamphlet you're holding!

00:11:53.296 --> 00:11:54.463
Can't you read!?

00:11:54.463 --> 00:11:56.382
I-I'm sorry!

00:11:56.382 --> 00:11:58.384
They're A-RISE. A-RISE!

00:11:58.384 --> 00:11:59.302
A-RISE?

00:12:00.177 --> 00:12:01.679
School idols.

00:12:03.139 --> 00:12:04.473
Idols...

00:12:04.473 --> 00:12:09.061
Yeah, musical idol groups formed in a school.
Have you seriously not heard of them?

00:12:11.188 --> 00:12:13.566
Kayo-chin, we're going to be late.

00:12:13.566 --> 00:12:14.775
Please wait just a bit more!

00:12:17.737 --> 00:12:20.031
So you're leaving?

00:12:20.614 --> 00:12:23.743
But I won't be chasing you down.

00:12:25.286 --> 00:12:31.000
Is there a crowd?
I'd rather avoid such a thing.

00:12:33.836 --> 00:12:37.590
Although, I understand the pain and
sadness that come with loneliness.

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:41.385
Every now and again,
we'll exchange a few words.

00:12:41.385 --> 00:12:45.097
Each of us in her own place,
each of us with her own feelings...

00:12:45.097 --> 00:12:48.267
We'll elevate EACH OTHER'S DAY!

00:12:48.267 --> 00:12:52.104
What to do, what to do, running private wars.

00:12:52.104 --> 00:12:55.733
See how we carry both justice
and cunning in our hands?

00:12:55.733 --> 00:12:59.528
What to do, what to do, running private wars.

00:12:59.528 --> 00:13:04.241
See how it takes nothing but a bit
of courage and passion?

00:13:10.122 --> 00:13:14.335
That was the moment when
I had my greatest idea ever!

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:16.003
This is it...

00:13:16.712 --> 00:13:18.339
My answer!

00:13:19.757 --> 00:13:21.133
Love Live!

00:13:23.010 --> 00:13:24.720
Look, look, look!

00:13:27.181 --> 00:13:28.432
Pardon me.

00:13:31.477 --> 00:13:33.396
They're idols! Idols!

00:13:33.604 --> 00:13:36.232
The student council believes we should
allow club activities to continue...

00:13:36.232 --> 00:13:37.942
as if the school were not closing.

00:13:37.942 --> 00:13:42.446
This group is from a high school in Osaka,
and these school idols are from Fukuoka!

00:13:42.446 --> 00:13:44.740
The notice said the school must close

00:13:44.740 --> 00:13:49.286
if the number of applicants falls
lower than the school's capacity.

00:13:49.286 --> 00:13:51.205
So like, if the number
exceeds capacity, then...

00:13:51.205 --> 00:13:54.333
School idols have been on the rise recently,

00:13:54.333 --> 00:13:57.711
and schools with popular idols have
had way more people applying!

00:13:58.087 --> 00:14:03.843
Yes, but we're in this situation precisely
because it's difficult to attract students.

00:14:04.301 --> 00:14:06.053
Any ideas to remedy this situation?

00:14:06.929 --> 00:14:09.432
So I was thinking...

00:14:09.432 --> 00:14:10.224
Huh?

00:14:10.975 --> 00:14:14.019
Umi-chan, I was totally mid-sentence there!

00:14:14.019 --> 00:14:16.147
...] have to run some urgent errands.

00:14:16.147 --> 00:14:19.358
But I thought of a good idea,
SO you gotta listen!

00:14:20.776 --> 00:14:23.988
You want to suggest we become
school idols, don't you?

00:14:24.864 --> 00:14:26.240
Umi-chan, you're an ESPer!?

00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:27.867
It was pretty obvious!

00:14:27.867 --> 00:14:30.077
That makes things easier, then.

00:14:30.077 --> 00:14:32.496
Let's go talk to the teachers
and form the "ldol Club"!

00:14:32.496 --> 00:14:33.706
I refuse.

00:14:33.706 --> 00:14:34.331
Why?

00:14:34.331 --> 00:14:37.710
Even if we act on our ideas, the situation
cannot be reversed with such ease.

00:14:38.252 --> 00:14:43.299
The student council should instead focus on
improving school life for current students only.

00:14:43.299 --> 00:14:45.301
But lookit, they're so cute!

00:14:45.301 --> 00:14:47.178
They're so sparkly!

00:14:47.178 --> 00:14:49.889
You don't get to dress this cool every day!

00:14:49.889 --> 00:14:52.808
Do you really think this would
attract more students?

00:14:52.808 --> 00:14:56.228
Well...not unless we're popular.

00:14:56.228 --> 00:15:02.359
The school idols in that magazine work
themselves as rigorously as professionals.

00:15:02.359 --> 00:15:06.739
Someone doing this out of sheer
whimsy like you will never succeed.

00:15:06.739 --> 00:15:09.241
But we cannot stand by and do nothing!

00:15:09.241 --> 00:15:10.242
Eli-chi.

00:15:12.661 --> 00:15:14.747
Thank you, Ayase-san.

00:15:14.747 --> 00:15:18.000
I'm happy to have heard
your sincere intentions.

00:15:19.877 --> 00:15:23.297
Allow me to make it crystal clear—no idols.

00:15:38.979 --> 00:15:40.773
Aw, man...

00:15:40.773 --> 00:15:44.026
I thought it was a good idea, too.

00:15:44.401 --> 00:15:46.612
Every now and then, we will see rainfall,

00:15:46.612 --> 00:15:52.409
but no water can spell trouble.

00:15:52.409 --> 00:15:55.037
We simply can't let things dry up,

00:15:55.037 --> 00:16:01.502
because everyone's dreaming
tree needs to grow.

00:16:03.003 --> 00:16:06.048
Oh, I love you—banzai!

00:16:06.048 --> 00:16:08.717
Stay strong, my courage.

00:16:08.717 --> 00:16:14.348
I truly wish to be able to enjoy the present.

00:16:14.348 --> 00:16:16.725
I love you—banzai!

00:16:16.725 --> 00:16:19.228
I will give it my best.

00:16:19.228 --> 00:16:24.233
Wave good-bye to yesterday,

00:16:24.233 --> 00:16:28.237
- and look ahead.
- Such a beautiful voice...

00:16:36.495 --> 00:16:39.873
Amazing! Super-de-duper! I was moved!

00:16:39.873 --> 00:16:41.375
I-It was nothing special.

00:16:41.375 --> 00:16:44.336
You're great at singing!
And you're great at the piano!

00:16:44.712 --> 00:16:47.214
And you're as cute as any idol!

00:16:51.302 --> 00:16:55.014
Um, I know this is sudden, but...

00:16:55.598 --> 00:16:58.309
Would you like to try being a school idol?

00:17:01.604 --> 00:17:02.563
What's with you?

00:17:02.563 --> 00:17:04.064
I don't get the joke!

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:07.610
Well, of course not...

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:22.166
I'll pierce your heart with my shot of love!

00:17:22.166 --> 00:17:23.250
BANG!

00:17:23.667 --> 00:17:25.878
What am I thinking!?

00:17:25.878 --> 00:17:27.755
You missed? That's unusual.

00:17:27.755 --> 00:17:30.758
Oh, um... Th-These things happen at times.

00:17:32.760 --> 00:17:34.720
LOVE ARROW, SHOOT!

00:17:37.473 --> 00:17:40.309
No! I mustn't imagine such foolish situations!

00:17:40.309 --> 00:17:43.437
Umi-chan, you got a sec?

00:17:46.106 --> 00:17:47.608
It's all Honoka's fault.

00:17:47.608 --> 00:17:50.277
I'm entirely unable to focus during practice.

00:17:50.277 --> 00:17:53.697
Well, maybe that means you're
interested in being an idol.

00:17:54.365 --> 00:17:56.075
No! It's...

00:17:56.784 --> 00:17:59.119
I just don't see it going well.

00:17:59.119 --> 00:18:03.874
But Honoka-chan's always the one
who comes up with crazy ideas.

00:18:03.874 --> 00:18:05.250
What?

00:18:05.250 --> 00:18:06.752
Let's climb it!

00:18:06.752 --> 00:18:09.672
That's impossible! We can't
climb such a giant tree!

00:18:09.672 --> 00:18:14.343
She'd make us go to places or
do things that we were scared of.

00:18:14.343 --> 00:18:17.596
And due to that, we'd always
find ourselves in trouble.

00:18:18.889 --> 00:18:19.890
Well, yeah.

00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:21.850
Honoka has always been too pushy!

00:18:22.601 --> 00:18:26.230
But Umi-chan, have you
ever regretted any of it?

00:18:26.230 --> 00:18:27.106
What?

00:18:28.482 --> 00:18:30.526
I'm scared!

00:18:41.412 --> 00:18:42.371
Look.

00:18:54.591 --> 00:18:56.301
Ow!

00:18:57.845 --> 00:19:00.097
This is really hard.

00:19:00.597 --> 00:19:02.850
I'm amazed they can do this.

00:19:02.850 --> 00:19:04.810
All right, from the top!

00:19:04.810 --> 00:19:06.395
Ready, and...

00:19:06.395 --> 00:19:07.896
Hey, Umi-chan...

00:19:08.731 --> 00:19:11.358
I think I'll give it a shot.

00:19:12.776 --> 00:19:14.778
What'll you do?

00:19:20.117 --> 00:19:21.660
Ow!

00:19:26.623 --> 00:19:27.708
Umi-chan...

00:19:27.708 --> 00:19:30.502
There's no point in practicing alone.

00:19:31.128 --> 00:19:33.297
If we're going to do this, the three
of us must practice together.

00:19:35.174 --> 00:19:36.508
Umi-chan!

00:19:42.848 --> 00:19:43.599
What is this?

00:19:43.599 --> 00:19:46.101
Our application to form an Idol Club!

00:19:46.101 --> 00:19:47.686
I can see that much.

00:19:47.686 --> 00:19:49.646
So you'll approve it?

00:19:49.646 --> 00:19:54.067
No. A club requires at least five members.

00:19:54.067 --> 00:19:54.693
What?

00:19:54.693 --> 00:19:59.072
I've heard that plenty of clubs with fewer
than five members exist at this school.

00:19:59.072 --> 00:20:02.451
They all had at least five members
when they first formed, I'm sure.

00:20:02.910 --> 00:20:04.620
Please find two more people.

00:20:04.953 --> 00:20:06.288
Two more...

00:20:06.789 --> 00:20:07.998
Understood.

00:20:07.998 --> 00:20:08.707
Let's go.

00:20:08.707 --> 00:20:09.917
Wait.

00:20:10.793 --> 00:20:13.170
Why are you forming an Idol Club now?

00:20:13.504 --> 00:20:15.214
You girls are second years, aren't you?

00:20:15.214 --> 00:20:17.549
We want to do something to
keep the school from closing!

00:20:17.549 --> 00:20:21.720
School idols are really
popular right now, so I...

00:20:21.720 --> 00:20:26.099
If that's the case, I cannot accept your
application, even with enough members.

00:20:26.099 --> 00:20:27.851
What? Why not?

00:20:27.851 --> 00:20:30.771
Club activities aren't meant to be used
to gather prospective students.

00:20:31.230 --> 00:20:34.942
Even if we act on such ideas,
the situation cannot be reversed.

00:20:36.443 --> 00:20:43.158
Stop this ridiculous line of thinking and focus
on making your remaining time here count.

00:20:44.618 --> 00:20:46.245
Don't let it get you down.

00:20:47.412 --> 00:20:49.790
Honoka-chan, you didn't do anything wrong.

00:20:50.165 --> 00:20:50.916
Yeah.

00:20:51.250 --> 00:20:55.212
I'm certain the student council president
understands your feelings.

00:20:57.422 --> 00:21:02.594
What you said before... I wish I could say the
same thing to a certain someone I know.

00:21:02.594 --> 00:21:05.430
You tend to say too much as it is, Nozomi.

00:21:06.682 --> 00:21:09.476
That's the vice president's job, though.

00:21:09.476 --> 00:21:12.271
But if our club application isn't accepted,

00:21:12.271 --> 00:21:15.232
we won't be able to use the auditorium,
and we won't have a club room.

00:21:15.816 --> 00:21:17.401
We won't be able to proceed.

00:21:17.901 --> 00:21:19.570
Yeah, good point...

00:21:26.118 --> 00:21:28.328
In that case, what should we do?

00:21:28.745 --> 00:21:31.790
What should we do?

00:21:35.919 --> 00:21:40.716
Because I felt the possibility,

00:21:40.716 --> 00:21:45.512
I knew to carry on.

00:21:45.512 --> 00:21:50.434
I don't want to have any more regrets.

00:21:50.434 --> 00:21:56.857
Our destined path is before us, so...

00:21:56.857 --> 00:22:01.612
LET'S GO! DO! I DO! I LIVE!

00:22:01.612 --> 00:22:05.991
YES, DO!1 DO! I LIVE!

00:22:05.991 --> 00:22:08.076
LET'S GO, LET'S GO, yeah!

00:22:10.871 --> 00:22:12.331
ONE, TWO, THREE, FOUR!

00:22:17.419 --> 00:22:22.507
Face forward, face upward,
don't sit and wait for anything.

00:22:22.507 --> 00:22:25.093
Let's do this now. Let's do this quick.

00:22:25.093 --> 00:22:27.596
Doesn't really matter where!

00:22:27.596 --> 00:22:32.601
The sun is shining brightly, giving
the future a warm welcome.

00:22:32.601 --> 00:22:34.811
So let's go, let's go together,

00:22:34.811 --> 00:22:37.940
and head to TOMORROW!

00:22:38.774 --> 00:22:41.485
This passionate heart
(is too hot to handle).

00:22:41.485 --> 00:22:43.987
I clutch it and run
(it's so, so painful).

00:22:43.987 --> 00:22:46.490
Come here, everyone
(closer, closer)!

00:22:46.490 --> 00:22:51.703
We want to find our potential
by never standing still.

00:22:52.704 --> 00:22:53.413
LET'S GO!

00:22:53.413 --> 00:22:55.332
We can turn this world around!

00:22:55.332 --> 00:22:57.834
DO! 1 DO! I LIVE!
(Yeah, yeah, yeah!)

00:22:57.834 --> 00:22:58.502
LET'S GO!

00:22:58.502 --> 00:23:02.839
As long as the possibility still exists,
we'll never give up! (Yeah, yeah, yeah!)

00:23:02.839 --> 00:23:07.886
LET'S GO show our natural smiles!
DO! 1 DO! I LIVE! (Yeah, yeah, yeah!)

00:23:07.886 --> 00:23:08.637
LET'S GO!

00:23:08.637 --> 00:23:13.058
We found the possibility, and now we can
shine with energy! (Yeah, yeah, yeah!)

00:23:13.058 --> 00:23:15.143
There is still a place for us to live!

00:23:15.143 --> 00:23:19.856
LET'S GO! DO! I DO! I LIVE!

00:23:19.856 --> 00:23:24.236
YES, DO!1 DO! I LIVE!

00:23:24.236 --> 00:23:27.114
LET'S GO, LET'S GO...yeah!

00:23:30.575 --> 00:23:32.911
I'm definitely gonna do this.

00:23:32.911 --> 00:23:34.830
And when I say that, I really mean it!

00:23:35.831 --> 00:23:39.126
Next time on Love Live!
"Let's be Idols!"
